    "You can change any of them in iOS Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Help & about (S07): Permissions help",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يمكنك تغيير أيٍّ منها من إعدادات iOS."
          }
        },
        "be" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
